<title>FRANCE: French 97 welfare deficit 35-38 bln francs -audit.</title>
<headline>French 97 welfare deficit 35-38 bln francs -audit.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 1997 welfare deficit in France's main social security fund is running at 35-38 billion francs, compared to 30.4 billion francs forecast in the Social Security Finance Act, Budget Minister Christian Sautter said.</p>
<p>He was presenting to a news conference the results of an audit by officials of the Court of Auditors.</p>
</text>
